        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">polymer electrolyte membrane (PEM) fuel cell for stationary cogeneration. Performance, stack lifetime and catalyst use according to expected future values for a serial product. Operation with connection to low pressure gas network. Electrical efficiency 32%, total efficiency 87%.\n\n# Included processes\nThe module includes an estimation for materials and transport used for the maintenance of the PEM fuel cell unit.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
